/home/lixinyu/snap/a/as/ceshi/32/codegen_logs/5.log:43:- **Key**: Three-step pipeline with no shortcuttable step. You cannot determine placeholder colors without counting holes (topological analysis), cannot pick the right color without indexing the legend (cross-region lookup), and cannot apply the result without locating the contained placeholder (spatial containment). The most hidden rule is that legend position encodes hole count — this requires comparing at least two examples with components of different hole counts to confirm the mapping is positional, not arbitrary.
